  {
   "id": "motorslice-304745@major-2026-05-26",
   "gameId": "motorslice-304745",
   "displayName": "Pre-Update - Beta Gameplay tweaks invitation!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-05-26T16:29:49.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello slicers!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "I've been working non-stop on tweaking the gameplay since the last patch.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "I now have a version that's intended to deal with the main criticisms of the game in the negative feedback, and improve the game feel.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "But before I turn this into the default version of the game, I want to know if I am on the right direction!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "So I invite you, particularly those who had any trouble with something, and especially the ones who made a negative review, to try this beta version through this week (May 26 - June 1) and let me know what you think.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Do the changes improve your experience with the game? Does it feel better? I want to know all your thoughts, so please try and don't hold back.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "To access this beta, do the following",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Go to your Steam library > right click > Properties > Game versions & Betas > Select \"betatest\"",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The most obvious tweaks were wall running/climbing angle detection, air control, and motorslice swap improvements.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Please share your thoughts on this thread, or create a steam forum post, or join my Discord server!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "You can check the pre-update patch notes with everything",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Removed the small force when walking off a ledge. You fall almost instantly now",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "MotorSlice angle adjust",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "MotorSlice swap tweaks, and it is now faster",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Jump Arc tweak to make it feel less “floaty”",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Increased jump forward momentum, and you can control the Forward jump momentum by holding movement input",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Jump has input dampening now",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Increased air control and tweak values to feel less “clunky”",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Tweaks on wall run angle detection",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Reduced the rotation drag movement, to feel sharper",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Reduced the magnetism strength",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Adjusted how magnetism works",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Reduced drag when walking off a wall run",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Tweaked wall run jump angle control",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Tweaked crack jump values to reduce missinput",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added visual feedback on saw projectile",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Jump distance is also determined by the movement input, not only holding jump and velocity",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Increase control when rolling/sliding",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Removed holding jump (input buffering) while climbing",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added ‘hold restart’ prompt when falling to your death",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added missing tutorials on some specific spots",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Speedup crack walking change direciton animations",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Overall tweaks to feel better",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Introducing",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Wall Grab when sliding or rolling - press up/jump to climb / crouch to fall / down+jump to jump backwards",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Motorslice down when holding down while slicing vertical",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
