  {
   "id": "motorslice-304745@major-2026-05-10",
   "gameId": "motorslice-304745",
   "displayName": "uPdate - First Patch",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-05-10T18:02:15.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello, in the past few days I've been working to fix the two major problems of the release, they should be fixed now.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "A rare save corruption problem when force quitting during save or loading",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "A teleportation bug when going out of bounds, making you respawn on a completely different checkpoint",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "I also addressed a small issue for streamers with the display name ingame.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The next patch will be focused on overall bug fixes, and after that, some gameplay tweaks from feedback.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "And thanks again for all support! Stay slicing!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "edit: Uploaded a hotfix for this update. Fixing the menu getting stuck",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45048810/abdc8fca79e2707b37893c51f1ec25e3239d339b.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
