  {
   "id": "motorslice-304745@post-2025-10-21",
   "gameId": "motorslice-304745",
   "displayName": "TOP 50 AT STEAM NEXT FEST",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2025-10-21T16:17:59.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "MotorSlice is one of the top 50 most played demo at the October Steam Next Fest! As a tiny indie, this is WILD.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Unbelievable! Thank you so much for everyone who made made this possible! UNLIMITED POWER",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45048810/1015a3e6a7fc5ab19f5b52a31482055e03f34663.gif\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "But with so many people playing with P, some weird bugs also appear, so I'm releasing a small patch, mostly bug fixes:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "A bug making the CONTINUE button enabled when there’s no save created, making you start the game on a blank level. I was only aware of this 2 days ago, and I apologize anyone who got this problem. Really frustrating.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "A bug preventing the combat arena wall to deactivate",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added lock-on on the boss",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Jump distance is now by how long you hold the jump and by speed",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "You don't loose speed when motorslicing",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Reduced some camera movements when you disable camera bob",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fix some minor bugs",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Tweaks on the the gameplay magnetism",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The demo will stay here, so don't worry. Also I don't plan on keep updating the demo from now on, and just focus on finishing the game! While I don't have a release window yet, the game is almost done!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "STAY WITH ME",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
